      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\"message\":\"\u2705 Referral opportunity 'Success LLC Referral' has been created for Alex Thompson. You can now share the referral link or details with your colleagues. Let me know if you need anything else!\"}",
        "tool_calls": null
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "That's great news! Thank you for setting that up so quickly. I'll make sure to share the details with my team at Success LLC. Is there anything specific I should keep in mind when referring them, or any follow-up steps I need to take on my end?"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\"message\":\"You\u2019re doing a great job! Here are a few quick pointers to keep the referral process smooth:\\n\\n1. **Share the referral link** \u2013 If you have a unique referral URL or code, give it to your colleagues so they can sign up directly. That way we can track the referral accurately.\\n2. **Highlight the benefits** \u2013 Remind them of the key features they love (e.g., easy lead tracking, automated follow\u2011ups, or the reporting dashboard). A short demo or a one\u2011pager can help.\\n3. **Set expectations** \u2013 Let them know the timeline for onboarding and any support you\u2019ll provide (e.g., a quick training session or a dedicated account manager).\\n4. **Follow\u2011up** \u2013 After they sign up, check in after a week to see if they need help getting started. A quick \u201chow\u2011is\u2011it\u2011going?\u201d note can reinforce trust.\\n5. **Track the referral** \u2013 Since we\u2019ve already created the opportunity, you can monitor its progress in the CRM. If you\u2019d like a status update or a reminder task, just let me know and I\u2019ll set it up.\\n\\nIf you need a referral link, a personalized email template, or anything else, just ask. Happy referring!\"}",
        "tool_calls": null
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          "That's really helpful, thank you! I'll definitely keep those tips in mind, especially the part about setting expectations and following up. I think a quick training session for my team would be a great way to get them started.",
          "",
          "Is there a specific person I should contact to schedule that training, or is that something I can arrange directly through my account manager? Also, just to confirm, since the referral opportunity is already created, will I be able to see the status updates right here in my dashboard, or do I need to request those separately?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\"message\":\"Great to hear you\u2019re planning a training session! Here\u2019s how it works:\\n\\n1. **Who to contact** \u2013 Your dedicated account manager is the best point of contact for scheduling training. If you don\u2019t have a direct line, you can reach out to the support team at support@ourcrm.com or use the \u201cContact Account Manager\u201d button in your dashboard. They\u2019ll coordinate the session and send you a calendar invite.\\n\\n2. **Training options** \u2013 We offer:\\n   * **Live 1\u2011hour workshop** (in\u2011person or virtual) \u2013 covers onboarding, best practices, and Q&A.\\n   * **Self\u2011paced video series** \u2013 available on our portal.\\n   * **Custom demos** \u2013 tailored to your team\u2019s workflow.\\n\\n3. **Referral opportunity visibility** \u2013 Once the opportunity is created, its status updates (e.g., \u201cNew,\u201d \u201cIn Progress,\u201d \u201cClosed\u2011Won\u201d) are automatically reflected in your dashboard under the \u201cOpportunities\u201d tab. You don\u2019t need to request separate updates; just refresh the page or check the notification panel. If you\u2019d like a more detailed report or a custom dashboard widget, let me know and I can set that up.\\n\\n4. **Next steps** \u2013 If you\u2019d like me to ping your account manager now or schedule a quick call to confirm the training slot, just say the word. I\u2019m here to make the process as smooth as possible.\\n\\nLooking forward to helping your team get the most out of the CRM!\"}",
        "tool_calls": null
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          "That's perfect, thank you for clarifying everything. I'll reach out to my account manager directly to schedule that live workshop for my team. And regarding the referral opportunity, I'll keep an eye on the \"Opportunities\" tab in my dashboard to track the progress.",
          "",
          "I think I have everything I need to get started with the referrals now. Thanks again for your help, and for making the setup so smooth!"
        ]
      }
